# Keep line endings exactly as they are on disk.
# Skills and scripts here are a mix of LF and CRLF, and several were carefully
# preserved that way during the fork. Letting Git renormalize them would produce
# whole-file diffs that bury real changes.
* -text

# Binary files, never diff or convert.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pptx binary
